#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
supervisor-router — High-IQ Multi-Brain Agent Supervisor with Zero-Downtime Failover.

Implements the October 2026 Zero-Bottleneck AI Code Review architecture:
1. Separation of Powers: Independent model family between Builder and Reviewer.
2. Multi-Brain Cascade:
   - Claude Code CLI (Sonnet / Opus)
   - OpenRouter Frontier (Qwen3-Coder 480B [256K-1M ctx], DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, GPT-OSS 120B)
   - DeepSeek Direct API (DeepSeek V4.1 Flash, DeepSeek V4 Pro)
   - Cloudflare Workers AI (GLM-4.7-Flash)
   - Antigravity Headless (Gemini 3.8 Flash High, Claude Sonnet, GPT-OSS 120B)
   - Local Ollama (DeepSeek-R1, Qwen2.5-7B, Llama3.2) — 100% offline, zero-quota
3. Prefix-Caching Optimization:
   - Invariant system persona, rubric & JSON schema placed first in KV cache.
   - Dynamic git diff & gate evidence placed at tail for maximum cache reuse (90-98% savings).
4. Zero Data Retention (ZDR) headers and hard read-only execution.

Usage:
    supervisor-router <rubric.md> <prompt-text> <schema-json-or-file> <out.json>
    supervisor-router --status
    supervisor-router --clear-cache
"""

